{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1449246-impossible-cover-details","id":1449246,"title":"Impossible cover details","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-22T07:08:03-07:00","id":1449246,"title":"Impossible cover details","content":"What happens if let's say my Demon who's cover is a 20 something year old in 2016 who makes a pact with a woman who was married in let's say 1945 and her husband died in the 50s, to get her dead ex-husband as a piece of their cover? If you try to integrate the part into the cover i mean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T08:22:30-07:00","id":1449252,"title":"","content":"Probably go into that bit from the core on how covers have some incongruous details about them. I feel like it would also vary based on the detail you're grabbing. The detail where your husband died years back might slot more easily into the hypothetical cover than if you grabbed the entire marriage as part of your cover. You'd have it and the appropriate people and details would reflect your cover having a dead husband. Though once people start prying the risk of an integrity check would go up. If the deceased's kids were there when he died they'd remember you being there as well, but might be a bit confused as to why you haven't aged since then or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T09:05:48-07:00","id":1449260,"title":"","content":"A demon in situation probably benefits from saying they were married and never drawing attention to the details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-24T06:14:19-07:00","id":1449450,"title":"","content":"I'd tend to suspect that crafty demons would barter away only a peculiar element in this case such as &quot;my husband died before me&quot; and not precisely the years he died (which would probably lead to some interesting ripples effect for the mortal widow and her family/friends since it could mean her husband didn't die or just died recently) or would actually keep such an element for a new Cover he is crafting.<br /> <br /> After all, as far as I understand the rules, even a Demon who could sustain only one full-blown Cover can have burnt Covers or accrue elements to patch together for future use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}